  "bodyHash": "pVC5lTXoRM4=",
  "content": "<div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_header.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/development status-Active-brightgreen?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"開發狀態徽章\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2PvYZfjWDf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/834250417130831903?color=blue&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord徽章\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_whatisthis.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一個高度可設定的模組，讓您能完全控制不死圖騰的行為方式，同時也新增了多項功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">下方是一個範例設定檔（模組版本2.1.0），展示模組提供的所有功能，並附上行內註解說明每個設定的作用。<br></span></p><div>{</div><div>&nbsp; // Minecraft功能</div><div>&nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">defaultTotemFeatures</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">healthUponUse</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">1</span>, // 圖騰觸發時玩家恢復的生命值數量。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">clearEffectsUponUse</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 若為true，使用圖騰時會清除（負面及正面）狀態效果。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">fireResistance</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">enabled</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 啟用或停用圖騰使用時的火焰抗性。&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">duration</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">800 </span>// 火焰抗性效果持續時間（以刻計算）。20刻=1秒，因此800刻=40秒。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">regeneration</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">enabled</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 啟用或停用圖騰使用時的再生效果。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">duration</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">900</span>, // 再生效果持續時間（以刻計算）。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">amplifier</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">1</span> // 再生效果的增幅等級。1=再生II，2=再生III，以此類推。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">absorption</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">enabled</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 啟用或停用圖騰使用時的吸收效果。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">duration</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">100</span>, // 吸收效果持續時間（以刻計算）。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">amplifier</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">1 </span>// 吸收效果的增幅等級。1=吸收II，以此類推。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</div><div>&nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; // 模組功能</div><div>&nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">newTotemFeatures</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">canUseTotemFromInventory</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">false</span>, // 允許直接從物品欄使用圖騰（無需拿在副手）。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; // 僅在確實需要時才應用火焰抗性和水下呼吸效果</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; // （例如：只有在燃燒時才給予火焰抗性；只有在水下窒息時才給予水下呼吸）。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">applyEffectsOnlyWhenNecessary</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>,</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; // 一個可添加自訂效果及觸發條件的空間。&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">customEffects</span>\": [&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{</div><div>\"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">effect</span>\": \"<span style=\"color:#3598db\">minecraft:speed</span>\", // 要給予的生物效果，例如 'minecraft:blindness'。</div><div>\"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">duration</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">200</span>, // 效果持續時間（以刻計算，20刻=1秒）。</div><div>\"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">amplifier</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">1</span>, // 效果增幅等級（0=等級1，1=等級2，以此類推）。</div><div>\"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">damageType</span>\": \"<span style=\"color:#3598db\">any</span>\" // 觸發此效果的傷害類型。使用 'any' 表示任何傷害都會觸發，例如 'minecraft:out_of_world' 或 'any'。</div><div>}</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; ],&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">waterBreathing</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">enabled</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 啟用或停用圖騰使用時的水下呼吸效果。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">duration</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">800 </span>// 水下呼吸效果持續時間（以刻計算）。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">destroyBlocks</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">whenSuffocating</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 在狹窄空間中窒息時自動破壞周圍方塊。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">whenFullyFrozen</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 若在粉雪中完全凍結時自動破壞周圍方塊。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">totemCantDestroy</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">[]</span> // 圖騰無法破壞的方塊列表。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">knockbackMobs</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">enabled</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 啟用或停用圖騰使用時產生擊退衝擊波，將附近生物彈開。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">radius</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">3.0</span>, // 擊退效果影響生物的範圍（以方塊為單位）。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">strength</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">2.5 </span>// 擊退效果的強度。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">cooldown</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">enabled</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">false</span>, // 啟用或停用圖騰再次使用前的冷卻時間。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">cooldown</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">200 </span>// 冷卻時間（以刻計算）。200刻=10秒。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">teleportOutOfVoid</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">enabled</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 若掉入虛空，會傳送離開。&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">teleportHeightOffset</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">64 </span>// 傳送時與虛空之間的垂直偏移高度。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">totemResistanceType</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">infinity</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">false </span>// 若為true，帶有無限附魔的圖騰擁有無限使用次數，不會被消耗。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; }</div><div>&nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">charm</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">canUseTotemFromCharmSlot</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 若啟用，圖騰可放置在專屬的「護符」欄位中以觸發效果。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">displayTotemOnChest</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">true</span>, // 若為true，圖騰會顯示為穿戴在玩家胸前的物品。</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; // 圖騰穿戴在胸前時，於玩家模型上渲染的X、Y、Z偏移量。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">xOffset</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">0.0</span>,</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">yOffset</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">0.0</span>,</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">zOffset</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">0.0</span></div><div>&nbsp; },</div><div>&nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">blacklists</span>\": {</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">blacklistedDimensions</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">[]</span>, // 圖騰不會觸發的維度（例如 \"minecraft:the_nether\"）。</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; \"<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">blacklistedStructures</span>\": <span style=\"color:#3598db\">[]</span> // 圖騰不會觸發的結構（例如 \"minecraft:village\"）。</div><div>&nbsp; }</div><div>}</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">部分新功能影片：</span></p><div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wmSHYSV.gif\" alt=\"圖騰保護\" width=\"395\" height=\"222\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/8SwGzoD.gif\" alt=\"圖騰擊退\" width=\"395\" height=\"222\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/KwtVmh6.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"395\" height=\"222\"></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_compatibility.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組內建與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a>的相容性，讓您可以從護符欄位使用圖騰。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventorio-forge/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventorio</a>相容，讓您可以從工具腰帶使用圖騰。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我正在努力讓模組與Charm of Undying有更佳的相容性。</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_support.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1110\" height=\"73\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">請將所有錯誤、問題及功能請求回報至<a href=\"https://github.com/CerbonXD/BetterTotemOfUndying/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>，或使用我的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2PvYZfjWDf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord伺服器</a>並在適當的頻道回報。請僅在留言區留下關於模組的評論。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在回報錯誤、問題或功能請求前，請先閱讀<a href=\"https://github.com/CerbonXD/BetterTotemOfUndying/blob/master/FAQ.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">常見問題(FAQ)</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_otherprojcts.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1110\" height=\"73\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這並非我唯一的專案。如果您喜歡這個模組，您可能也會喜歡我的其他作品。給它們一個機會，您不會後悔的。</span></p><h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cerbons-better-beacons\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的烽火台(Better Beacons)</a></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-beacons-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Beacons Reforged</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_needaserver.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1110\" height=\"73\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fCerbon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/CERBONs_Better_Totem_of_Undying/BH_CBTU_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"250\"></a></span></p>",
